  "description": "The CoreVar.CommandLineInterface.Blazor library extends the powerful features of the CoreVar CLI framework into the Blazor environment, allowing developers to seamlessly integrate command-line interfaces within Blazor applications. This package provides custom Blazor components and services that facilitate the creation of interactive CLI tools, enabling real-time command execution and response within a web interface. It’s perfect for developers aiming to enhance their Blazor applications with dynamic CLI capabilities, improving user interaction and backend manageability.",
